<title>USA: Intl Specialty Products Inc Q3 net higher.</title>
<headline>Intl Specialty Products Inc Q3 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>INTERNATIONAL SPECIALTY PRODUCTS INC</p>
<p>					   Third Quarter   Nine Months</p>
<p>				     1996     1995	 1996    1995</p>
<p> Net sales			$173.6  $167.8     $544.1  $530.3</p>
<p> Net income			 20.1    17.6	 62.6    51.2</p>
<p> Earnings per common share     .21     .18	  .64     .52</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs (thousands)  97,107  98,230     97,447  98,876</p>
<p> EBITDA(A)			  51.1    48.1	158.2   142.6</p>
<p>	    (Millions of Dollars, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>(A)  EBITDA represents earnings before income taxes, increased by interest expense, depreciation and goodwill amortization.</p>
</text>
